<div class="sprite-grid">
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-face-monster">
<div class="sprite-name">face monster</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(face_monster_1,12;face_monster_2,12;face_monster_3,12;face_monster_4,12)(face_monster)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 1</span><span>run by its #R$CDB1(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Wanders at random. A ball hit destroys it.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-hive">
<div class="sprite-name">hive</div>
<div class="sprite-stage"><div class="sprite-take">#FRAMES(hive_1,12;hive_2,12;hive_3,12)(hive)<div class="sprite-phase">idle</div></div><div class="sprite-take">#FRAMES(hive_spawn_burst_1,12;hive_spawn_burst_2,12;hive_spawn_burst_3,12)(hive_spawn_burst)<div class="sprite-phase">spawn burst</div></div></div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 3</span><span>run by its #R$CEB3(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Wanders sideways and homes on your bat's row. Spawns bees.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-ball-gem">
<div class="sprite-name">ball gem</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(gem_fly_1,4;gem_fly_2,4;gem_fly_3,4;gem_fly_4,4;gem_fly_3,4;gem_fly_2,4)(gem_fly)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 4</span><span>run by its #R$9E89(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Wanders. A hit from ball A puts ball B in play.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-bee">
<div class="sprite-name">bee</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(bee_1,4;bee_2,4)(bee)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>a level spawns it from Level 4</span><span>run by its #R$CFB1(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Flies across at your bat and stings it. A sting freezes your control of the bat until the last ball in play is lost or the next level starts. A hive spawns it from Level 3.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-diamond">
<div class="sprite-name">diamond</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(diamond_1,8;diamond_2,8;diamond_3,8;diamond_4,8;diamond_5,8;diamond_6,8)(diamond)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 6</span><span>run by its #R$CE27(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Homes on the ball.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-bowling-ball">
<div class="sprite-name">bowling ball</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(bowling_ball_1,8;bowling_ball_2,8;bowling_ball_3,8)(bowling_ball)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 8</span><span>run by its #R$CE5F(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Homes on your bat. When it reaches the bat, the bat locks for a moment, and the bowling ball is gone.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-warp-gate">
<div class="sprite-name">warp gate</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(warp_gate_1,8;warp_gate_2,8)(warp_gate)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 8</span><span>run by its #R$D47C(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Sits in your bat's column. Reach it with the bat to skip levels. The ball destroys it.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-hockey-mask">
<div class="sprite-name">hockey mask</div>
<div class="sprite-stage"><div class="sprite-take">#FRAMES(hockey_mask_armed,8)(hockey_mask_armed)<div class="sprite-phase">armed with a comet</div></div><div class="sprite-take">#FRAMES(hockey_mask_unarmed,8)(hockey_mask_unarmed)<div class="sprite-phase">unarmed</div></div></div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 11</span><span>run by its #R$D398(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Travels in a straight line, and turns only at walls. Drops a comet while you hold fire.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-capsule">
<div class="sprite-name">capsule</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(capsule_1,8;capsule_2,8;capsule_3,8;capsule_4,8)(capsule)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 12</span><span>run by its #R$D00C(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Wanders until it walks into a brick, which ends it. The brick takes a hit: a golden brick survives and a silver brick steps down. An orb that gives up becomes one.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-orb">
<div class="sprite-name">orb</div>
<div class="sprite-stage"><div class="sprite-take">#UDGARRAY2,7,3,2,tindex=1,alpha=0($E641,,2;$E640,,2;$E651,,2;$E650,,2)(orb_hunt)<div class="sprite-phase">hunt</div></div><div class="sprite-take">#FRAMES(orb_chew_1,12;orb_chew_2,12;orb_chew_3,12;orb_chew_4,8;orb_chew_5,8;orb_chew_6,8;orb_chew_7,8;orb_chew_8,8;orb_chew_9,8;orb_chew_10,8;orb_chew_11,8;orb_chew_12,8;orb_chew_13,8)(orb_chew)<div class="sprite-phase">chew</div></div><div class="sprite-take">#FRAMES(orb_spit_1,12;orb_spit_2,12;orb_spit_3,8)(orb_spit)<div class="sprite-phase">spit</div></div><div class="sprite-take">#UDGARRAY2,7,3,2,tindex=1,alpha=0($E821,,2;$E820,,2;$E831,,2;$E830,,2)(orb_ball)<div class="sprite-phase">spat-out ball</div></div></div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 13</span><span>run by its #R$D05B(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Hunts the ball, catches it, chews it, and spits it out over your losing edge: the ball is lost. If it cannot catch the ball in time, it turns into a capsule.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-visor">
<div class="sprite-name">visor</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(visor_1,8;visor_2,8;visor_3,8;visor_4,8)(visor)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 15</span><span>run by its #R$D20F(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Sits still for a while, then homes on the ball.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-dart">
<div class="sprite-name">dart</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(dart_1,8;dart_2,8;dart_3,8;dart_4,8)(dart)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 17</span><span>run by its #R$D4E8(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Wanders. When the ball destroys it, the other inhabitants freeze for a while.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-starburst">
<div class="sprite-name">starburst</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(starburst_1,4;starburst_2,4;starburst_3,4)(starburst)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 21</span><span>run by its #R$D2C6(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Wanders. A ball hit knocks it into a slide along the ball's heading, through bricks – golden included. The slide ends at a wall, past your losing edge, or when a ball hits it again.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-h-rotor">
<div class="sprite-name">H-rotor</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(h_rotor_1,8;h_rotor_2,8;h_rotor_3,8;h_rotor_4,8;h_rotor_5,8;h_rotor_6,8)(h_rotor)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 24</span><span>run by its #R$D186(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Travels in a straight line, and turns only at walls.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-wheel">
<div class="sprite-name">wheel</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(wheel_1,8;wheel_2,8;wheel_3,8;wheel_4,8)(wheel)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>debuts at Level 25</span><span>run by its #R$D1B9(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Bounces off walls and bricks, and zig-zags up and down as it goes. When one spawns, wheels fill every free inhabitant slot.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-comet">
<div class="sprite-name">comet</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(comet_1,4;comet_2,4;comet_3,4)(comet)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>a level spawns it from Level 52</span><span>run by its #R$D44B(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Falls straight down until a wall or a brick stops it. A hockey mask drops it while you hold fire, from Level 11. From Level 52 the level also spawns it on its own.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-ufo">
<div class="sprite-name">UFO</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(ufo_1,8;ufo_2,8)(ufo)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>run by its #R$CDE8(handler)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">Never appears. The shipped game has no script that spawns it.</div>
</div>
</div>

<h3 class="ref-subsection" id="shared-animation">Shared animation</h3>

<div class="paragraph">
Every animation here is a table of frame pointers, and a sprite listed twice in a row in its table holds twice as long. The #R$9460(ball-gem animation) is one such table.
</div>

<div class="paragraph">
Inhabitants and the ball gem spawn in the spawn flash. A comet that a hockey mask drops skips it and appears at once. An inhabitant destroyed in play dies in the death burst.
</div>

<div class="sprite-grid">
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-spawn-flash">
<div class="sprite-name">spawn flash</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(spawn_flash_1,8;spawn_flash_2,8;spawn_flash_3,8;spawn_flash_4,8;spawn_flash_5,4;spawn_flash_6,4)(spawn_flash)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>run by the #R$CBFE(reaction state machine)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">An inhabitant as it spawns.</div>
</div>
<div class="sprite-card" id="obj-death-burst">
<div class="sprite-name">death burst</div>
<div class="sprite-stage">#FRAMES(death_burst_1,8;death_burst_2,8;death_burst_3,8;death_burst_4,8;death_burst_5,8;death_burst_6,8;death_burst_7,8;death_burst_8,8)(death_burst)</div>
<div class="sprite-meta"><span>run by the #R$CBFE(reaction state machine)</span></div>
<div class="sprite-what">An inhabitant dying.</div>
</div>
</div>
